Package: fmcom
Type: Package
Title: Freshwater and Marine Contaminant Monitoring Dataset
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Anne", "Soerensen", email = "anne.soerensen@nrm.se", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: This package contains the freshwater and marine contaminant
    monitoring (fmcom) dataset, combining the marine
    contaminant monitoring programme (MCoM) for the Baltic Sea 
    previously published on github (https://github.com/NRM-MOC/mcomDb) 
    with the Swedish
    freshwater contaminant monitoring data. It also includes helper
    functions for reshaping the dataset (e.g. long to wide format).
